    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack Properties are delighted to present this well-maintained semi-detached bungalow, ideally located right in the heart of Prosperous village.\n\nOffered to the market in good condition, this lovely home benefits from clean, neutral and light-enhancing décor throughout. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation, comprising an entrance hallway, sitting room, bright and spacious kitchen/dining room, large bedroom with ensuite, guest WC and utility room.\n\nExternally, the property boasts a neat front lawn, private driveway and, most notably, large side access leading to the rear garden, offering excellent potential for future use or development, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\n\nThe property would make an ideal home for first-time buyers, downsizers or those seeking a conveniently located property.\n\nSituated perfectly in the centre of Prosperous village, the property is adjacent to a host of local amenities, including shops, schools, pubs, post office and bus services. \n\nProsperous also offers excellent access to Dublin via the N4 and N7 motorway networks. For those who enjoy the outdoors, Ballynafagh Lake, Kildare Maze and Donadea Forest Park are all within a short drive.\n\nWith its convenient village location, generous side access and excellent potential, this property represents a wonderful opportunity for a new owner.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this lovely home has to offer.\n\nPlease contact DNG McCormack Properties on 045 832 535 to arrange a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.72m x 2.77m\nTiled flooring\n\nLiving Room - 3.55m x 3.79m\nCarpeted flooring, feature cast iron fireplace with hardwood surround, coving\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 2.65m x 7.71m\nLarge spacious area, ceramic tiled flooring, fully fitted modern kitchen units at floor & eye level\n\nUtility Room - 1.69m x 1.16m\nCeramic tiled flooring, back door, plumbed\n\nBedroom - 2.69m x 3.51m\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobes\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.64m x 0.92m\nCeramic tiled flooring, wetroom, electric shower area, WC, WHB\n\nUpstairs storage area - 2.19m x 2.56m\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobes, velux window\n\nUpstairs storage area - \nCarpeted flooring, velux window, storage area\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Semi detached bungalow</li><li> Very central location close to all amenities</li><li> Bus stop right at entrance</li><li> Modern kitchen units</li><li> Tiled/ Carpeted flooring</li><li> Converted attic</li><li> Large side entrance</li><li> Mature hedges and shrubbery</li><li> Steel garden shed</li><li> Concrete rear yard</li><li> Lot of potential</li><li> Inclusions:</li><li> Carpets/ Flooring</li><li> Curtains/ Curtain poles</li><li> Blinds</li><li> Light Fittings</ul>"
      },
